      {
        "id": 142099,
        "name": "phantaskippy",
        "username": "phantaskippy",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/phantaskippy/{size}/1897_2.png",
        "created_at": "2015-05-25T02:11:00.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>1. &nbsp;Damage and all effects are resolved against truth, but line of sight and range are against the original target.</p><p>2. &nbsp;The only time cards are returned to hand is when a character takes damage, if Truth takes the damage, Dawn would not, so she wouldn't pick up cards.</p><p>3. &nbsp;This one I am uncertain of, but it should be before dice are rolled.</p>",
